  message: "Closed by PR #4286. Java analyzer now emits one imports edge per import declaration. Behavioral evidence: (1) Filed repro reproduced as TDD test TestJavaImportEdges.test_regular_and_stdlib_imports_emit_edges — a file with import java.util.List and import com.example.helper.Formatter previously emitted 0 imports edges (only calls); now emits both. (2) Ground-truth on spring-petclinic (47 files): 427 imports edges == 427 distinct source import specifiers, 0 missing, 0 spurious. (3) Emission-parity matrix cell (java, edge_imports) is now a passing hard lock (strict-xfail stripped). Static and wildcard imports covered; full import path in the module slot (parity with Go/C#) keeps spring-boot confirmed in refine_frameworks."  # a8ca
